    {
      "paper_id": "aos-2024-v52-i05-p2293",
      "local_id": "D4",
      "local_label": "Section 2 — Gaussian coupling convention",
      "source_heading": "Section 2 — Gaussian coupling convention",
      "source_kind": "source_passage",
      "statement_original": "Note that in principle such Gaussian approximations for random variables $(X_i)_{i=1}^n$ require a common, possibly enriched probability space $(\\Phi_c,\\mathcal A_c,\\mathbb P_c)$ on which the approximating Gaussian processes and random variables $(X_i^c)_{1\\le i\\le n}=_{\\mathcal D}(X_i)_{1\\le i\\le n}$ can be defined. In order for better readability, we omit this technicality and simply state our results in terms of the original random variables $X_i$’s.",
      "relation": "exact",
      "depends_on": [],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 4,
          "location": "Section 2 — Gaussian coupling convention"
        },
        {
          "page": 5,
          "location": "Section 2 — Gaussian coupling convention"
        }
      ],
      "highlight_symbols": [
        "(X_i^c)_{1\\le i\\le n}=_{\\mathcal D}(X_i)_{1\\le i\\le n}"
      ],
      "highlight_phrases": []
    },
    {
      "paper_id": "aos-2024-v52-i05-p2293",
      "local_id": "D5",
      "local_label": "Section 2.2 — Functional dependence (2.3)",
      "source_heading": "Section 2.2 — Functional dependence (2.3)",
      "source_kind": "definition",
      "statement_original": "With this system, given $k\\ge0$, a time lag, we measure the dependence from how much the outputs $X_i$ of this system will change if we replace the input information at time $i-k$ with an i.i.d. copy $\\varepsilon'_{i-k}$. For $p\\ge1$, define the uniform functional dependence\n\\[\n\\delta_p(k):=\\sup_i(\\mathbb E|X_i-X_{i,\\{i-k\\}}|^p)^{1/p},\\quad\\text{where }X_{i,\\{i-k\\}}=g_i(\\ldots,\\varepsilon_{i-k-1},\\varepsilon'_{i-k},\\varepsilon_{i-k+1},\\ldots,\\varepsilon_i)\n\\]\n(2.3)\nis a coupled version of $X_i$.",
      "relation": "exact",
      "depends_on": [
        "D1",
        "D2"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 5,
          "location": "Section 2.2 — Functional dependence (2.3)"
        }
      ],
      "highlight_symbols": [
        "\\delta_p(k)",
        "X_{i,\\{i-k\\}}"
      ],
      "highlight_phrases": []
    },
    {
