      "local_label": "Theorem 3.1 — Banded quadratic partial sums",
      "source_heading": "Theorem 3.1 — Banded quadratic partial sums",
      "source_kind": "theorem_excerpt",
      "statement_original": "Let $Q_n=\\sum_{1\\le s\\le t\\le n}a_{s,t}X_sX_t$, with $a_{s,t}=0$ if $|s-t|>D_n$ for some $D_n\\le n$, and $\\sup|a_{s,t}|\\le1$. Denote\n\\[\nR_k=\\sum_{j=1}^k(V_j-\\mathbb E(V_j)),\\quad\\text{where }V_k=\\sum_{t=(k-1)D_n+1}^{(kD_n)\\wedge n}\\sum_{1\\le s\\le t}a_{s,t}X_sX_t,\\quad\\text{for }1\\le k\\le\\lceil n/D_n\\rceil.\n\\]\n(3.3)",
      "relation": "exact",
      "depends_on": [],
